    "presentation_challenge_accounting": "Before holder.complete_vp, the verifier-to-holder logical request is counted in presentation_delivery as three separately encoded components: required_policy using Policy.canonical_bytes(), required_epoch as u64, and nonce as a length-prefixed byte string. This is the measurement convention even when the application provisions policy or epoch in advance.",
